        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Camilla Luddington, Catherine Middleton, Prince William, Stephanie Edwards, Jo Wilson, Roseanne\n- Works: Grey's Anatomy, Lifetime TV film about Catherine Middleton, Roseanne's Nuts\n- Organizations: ABC, Lifetime\n- Places: Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital\n- Roles: Catherine Middleton, Jo Wilson, surgical intern, resident, Duke of Cambridge\n\nFacts:\n- Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, née Middleton, was born on 9 January 1982 and is the wife of Prince William, Duke of Cambridge.\n- Roseanne's Nuts was a Lifetime reality show and docudrama that aired from July 13, 2011, to September 16, 2011.\n- Camilla Luddington is known for playing Catherine Middleton in a Lifetime TV film.\n- Camilla Luddington is also known for playing Jo Wilson in the ABC medical drama Grey's Anatomy.\n- In Grey's Anatomy, Stephanie Edwards is introduced as a surgical intern at Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, which is later renamed Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital.\n- In Grey's Anatomy, Stephanie Edwards advances to resident level alongside fellow intern and friend Jo Wilson, who is played by Camilla Luddington.",
